  "reasoning": "The defendant, while holding accounting and leadership positions in a religious organization, used his authority to submit false reimbursements and duplicate claims, diverting public funds of the organization amounting to 196,000 yuan. This constitutes the crime of embezzlement of public funds by a person in a position of trust, i.e., 职务侵占罪. Additionally, he misappropriated disaster‑relief donations (special earmarked funds) for personal and unrelated payments, totaling 132,000 yuan. Misuse of earmarked or special funds is punishable as 挪用特定款物罪. Both offenses are distinct and should be charged separately, with a combined sentence.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]职务侵占;挪用特定款物<eoa>"
}
